abstract: "Rigorous prefix cylinder law for Collatz 2-adic valuations (exact residue characterization, negative-binomial prefix law), a density-one prefix discrepancy bound, and a 3x4 computational matrix (M=64,128,256 x N=20,40,60,80, 10k samples/cell) plus exhaustive sweep to 10^7."
